    "description": "⛓⛓⛓ SEEDLING HAMMER-PHASE C2 D1 — THE GHOST SWORD AGAINST A SPINNER, ON THE GAME. `r9-solve-18`'s frozen staging (`witness-bases/r9-solve-18.hammer-a.json`) with ONE progress override, `seam.items.hasGhostSword` true (the sword is held too: a ghost sword alone never tests). The walk heads for `spinner@48,96` and presses at t 26, when the body is inside 20 px and the ghost rect (24 x 48) toward it overlaps it; then presses at +2, +8, +10, +18 with the facing key held. The swing lands at t 27 from 18.41 px (past the sword's 16), 2 damage; the +2 press DASHES and replaces the swing's window; the +8 press is SWALLOWED (the ghost dash's 6-tick release, which the sword chain would dash on); +10 and +18 dash; each dash tests 6 ticks. The i-frame run out, it aims and presses at t 75: the landing at t 76 makes hits 4 and kills the body (the sword needs three). No hit on the player. Authored by scripts/procgen/plan-seedling-hammer-c2-ghost.mjs.",
